	(descr "SHOU HAN TYPE-C 24PLT-H10.5 USB Type-C 24P vertical SMD receptacle. Land pattern from the manufacturer drawing: 24 pads 0.30x0.87 on 0.50 pitch, four board-lock ovals and TWO 0.62 locating holes (the LCSC footprint ships only one). Mouth 10.50 mm above the board. DRAWING ratings 20 V / 3 A / 5000 cycles / -30..+80 C; the LCSC page overstates all three.")
	(tags "USB-C Type-C vertical receptacle C3151750 SHOU HAN USB3.1")
